SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
---------------------

This license covers the ORIGINAL code and configuration of prismOS:

  scripts/                  build_iso.sh, set_edu_policy.sh, sync_overlays.sh,
                            verify_legacy_cpu.sh, generate_app_icons.sh,
                            provision_waydroid_image.sh, lib/
  overlays/                 overlay-prismos-common, overlay-prismos-{edu,home,
                            work,slim}, overlay-amd64-prismos (make.conf, Portage
                            profiles, ebuilds, systemd units, runtime scripts,
                            ART properties, board splitconfig)
  kernel/                   splitconfig chromiumos-x86_64/prismos_legacy
  profiles/                 app_pool.json, app_pool.schema.json, <edition>.conf
  docs/, README.md          documentation
  assets/                   brand artwork

  overlays/overlay-amd64-prismos/board/usr/share/icons/prismOS-Squircle/
                            icon theme (MIT licensed; see the LICENSE file
                            shipped inside the theme itself)

It does NOT cover the third-party components that a prismOS image embeds or
depends on. Each of them is subject to its own license and is distributed
according to the terms of its upstream project:

  ChromiumOS / Chromium / Ash-Aura     BSD-3-Clause and component licenses
  Gentoo Portage, eclasses, toolchain GPL-2 and per-package licenses
  Linux kernel (splitconfig included)  GPL-2
  Waydroid                             GPL-3
  LineageOS / Android (AOSP)           Apache-2.0, GPL-2, LGPL
  Wine, Proton                         LGPL-2.1+ and GPL-2+ with exceptions
  Mesa, crocus, i965, libva            MIT
  LXC                                  GPL-2
  Widevine CDM (Google)                proprietary Google terms: distributed
                                       exclusively through the channels
                                       provided by ChromiumOS, never
                                       redistributed in this repository

The icons generated by scripts/generate_app_icons.sh are original vector
placeholders (text glyph on a squircle background) and do NOT reproduce the
official logos of the cited applications. All trademarks and product names
belong to their respective owners and are cited for descriptive purposes only.
